# LIVE API, ALWAYS. Vite reads this on every `npm run build`.
#
# `src/api/index.ts` defaults to the MOCK adapter when VITE_API_MODE is
# unset, which is right for design review and wrong for a deployment: a
# build that forgets the flag serves fabricated findings that look
# exactly like real ones. The deploy script passes the flag, but a
# script is a thing someone can run by hand without.
#
# Committed deliberately. `.gitignore` excludes `.env`, not this file —
# there is nothing secret here, and the whole point is that it travels
# with the code so no build can be missing it.
#
# The sidebar footer is the check: "Connected to API" is right,
# "Mock data — no backend" means this file did not take effect.
VITE_API_MODE=http
